2026-06-24 09:33:32.634 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:258 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: The old theater kept an everlasting charm, though its curtain hung bent from years of rain.  
Every night, a restless crowd waited while the curtain trembled on its own in the wind.  
Inside, a thin tissue note rested on the stage, as if left by an everlasting actor.  
I touched the tissue, and my restless hands felt the bent edge of the curtain.  
Then the curtain opened on its own, revealing an everlasting glow behind the dusty scene.  
By morning, the restless theater looked alive again, its curtain and tissue still whispering everlastingly.
