2026-06-24 10:00:31.456 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:258 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: At the theater, Maya watched the rehearsal, hoping to perfect her role with quiet sophistication.  
She wore a simple disguise, because the director wanted the audience to believe she was a stranger.  
During another rehearsal, she found a solution to a broken scene, and everyone admired her sophistication.  
Maya wanted to aspire to a larger stage, where every entity on stage seemed alive and true.  
