2026-06-24 11:16:23.013 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:258 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: By the river, Mara carried a dozen sketches, seeking fame without losing her serenity.  
Her conviction was quiet, and she smiled at whatever weather the morning offered.  
A dozen walkers paused, drawn by her fame, otherwise passing her by unnoticed.  
She painted with conviction, because serenity mattered more than fame or applause.  
