2026-06-24 11:28:10.752 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:258 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: With quiet conviction, Mara opened the dozen-old diary and felt unusual serenity.  
She had no fame, but her conviction gave every ordinary morning a gentle purpose.  
A dozen gray streets stretched ahead, and she smiled, whatever the weather promised otherwise.  
