2026-06-29 16:17:11.671 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:258 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: After work, I wanted some leisure, so I walked to the quiet river path.  
I used the time to check my thoughts and enjoy a wholesome calm.  
My friend joined me for a small endeavor to deliver bread to the old shelter.  
On the way, we had to retrieve a dropped envelope and check the address again.  
